  "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds `data/plugins/fzqfzqfzq__dsh-checkin-hub.yml` — a sidebar check-in hub for WorkBuddy, Trae and Qoder.\n\nThe plugin aggregates the three installed connect plugins (`dsh-connect-workbuddy`, `dsh-connect-trae`, `@dmh2002/dsh-connect-qoder`): one-click or per-platform check-in over every pooled account, per-account credit balance, today's check-in state and expiring credits, a six-package credit breakdown, and account add/remove. It stores no credential and never calls a platform API directly — reads and writes go through those plugins' loopback routes, so it needs them enabled and signed in and reports that state when they are absent.\n\n- category: `usage` (matches the three existing check-in entries)\n- `dsh.bundle` declared; repo carries the `dsh-plugin` topic\n- installable from the pinned v1.1.0 release tarball; no build scripts, no dependencies\n- verified on this machine: sidebar row id `dsh-checkin-hub` at order 5 renders, and the panel shows live balances from the three plugins\n",
